  <section class="faith-intro">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow faith-intro-eyebrow">An Introduction</p>
      <p class="faith-intro-prose hero-excerpt-dropcap">The Westminster Larger Catechism, finalized alongside the Shorter in 1647, was written for the pulpit rather than the home - an exposition of the same doctrine in 196 questions, with longer answers, fuller scripture proofs, and more careful distinctions. Where the Shorter Catechism gives a definition, the Larger walks through implications. Where the Shorter answers in a sentence, the Larger answers in a paragraph. Together they remain the standards of the Reformed Presbyterian tradition.</p>
      <div class="flourish faith-intro-flourish">{{> "flourish-mark"}}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
    
